  "name": "Temporal Talents",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a time mage gains experience, he learns a number of talents that aid him and confound his foes. Starting at 2nd level, a time mage gains one temporal talent. He gains an additional temporal talent every two time mage levels after 2nd. A time mage cannot select an individual talent more than once. Talents marked with an asterisk require a time mage to spend motes, which he may do only once per round. A complete list of temporal talents is detailed on a separate reference page.</p>",
